"""
attention.py
============

Multi-Head Self-Attention

This module allows every token in a SMILES sequence to attend to every
other token, enabling the model to learn relationships between atoms
and molecular substructures.

Pipeline:

Input Embeddings
        │
        ▼
Linear Projections (Q, K, V)
        │
        ▼
Split into Multiple Heads
        │
        ▼
Scaled Dot-Product Attention
        │
        ▼
Concatenate Heads
        │
        ▼
Final Linear Projection
"""

"""
embedding.py
============

SMILES Embedding Layer

Converts token IDs into dense vector representations and adds
positional information before passing them to the transformer.

Pipeline:
    Token IDs
        ↓
    Token Embedding
        ↓
    Scale by √d_model
        ↓
    Positional Encoding
        ↓
    Dropout
"""

"""
encoder_layer.py
================

Single Transformer Encoder Block

Architecture:

Input
  │
  ▼
Multi-Head Self-Attention
  │
Add (Residual)
  │
Layer Normalization
  │
Feed Forward Network
  │
Add (Residual)
  │
Layer Normalization
  │
Output
"""

"""
encoder.py
==========

Transformer Encoder

Stacks multiple Transformer Encoder Layers to progressively refine
the token representations.

Architecture:

Input Embeddings
        │
        ▼
Encoder Layer 1
        │
        ▼
Encoder Layer 2
        │
        ▼
Encoder Layer 3
        │
        ▼
Encoder Layer 4
        │
        ▼
Output Token Embeddings
"""

"""
feed_forward.py
===============

Position-wise Feed Forward Network

Applies a two-layer fully connected network independently
to every token embedding.

Pipeline:
    Input
      ↓
Linear (d_model → d_ff)
      ↓
GELU
      ↓
Dropout
      ↓
Linear (d_ff → d_model)
"""

"""
model.py
========

SMILES Transformer Model

Encodes a tokenized SMILES sequence into a fixed-size molecular
embedding using a custom Transformer encoder.

Pipeline:

Input IDs
      │
      ▼
Embedding Layer
      │
      ▼
Transformer Encoder
      │
      ▼
Final Layer Normalization
      │
      ▼
CLS Token Pooling
      │
      ▼
Molecular Embedding
"""
"""
positional_encoding.py
======================

Sinusoidal Positional Encoding

Transformers process all tokens simultaneously and therefore have
no inherent understanding of token order. Positional encoding adds
unique position information to each token embedding.

Pipeline:
    Token Embeddings
          +
    Positional Encoding
          ↓
    Position-Aware Embeddings
"""
"""
test.py
========

Simple test script for the custom SMILES Transformer.

Checks:
    ✓ Tokenizer
    ✓ Embedding layer
    ✓ Transformer encoder
    ✓ Output shapes
"""

"""
tokenizer.py
============

SMILES Tokenizer for Molecular Transformer

This module converts SMILES strings into token IDs that can be
processed by the transformer.

Pipeline:
    SMILES
        ↓
    Regex Tokenization
        ↓
    Vocabulary Mapping
        ↓
    Token IDs
"""

